{"c":[{"id":"806a636804d6e5d8","sum":"Chrome page fields: once web AX is on, Chrome ignores native AX writes (HostCoordinator yields via PageInline.nativeYields); PageTaskMachine.publish invalidates its own live offer before republishing, or onDisplaced drops the page task.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261006T172603Z-a7ca0252d9058e55","text":"Once an assistive app turns on Chrome's web accessibility, native ghost text sees page fields, but Chrome ignores its AX writes (writeIgnored): Tab is eaten. HostCoordinator yields to page inline text via PageInline.nativeYields.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T211151Z-05df8b8f447e91f6","text":"H14: PageTaskMachine.publish must invalidate its own live offer before republishing (a click changes the preview without a key): otherwise the arbiter's onDisplaced puts the whole page task away.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"cfa933fb97832a8e","sum":"H14 rig: guest has no Jev; drive attach rows with hook 'pagetask start <goalProgress>' (pageTask.lastAccept* shows Tab). Banners cover top-right panels: give canned page goals a lower viewport. clickableContent panels need a mouse move before a click.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261006T211204Z-63399dc84dfcee60","text":"H14: the rig guest has no Jev, so an Ask gives no page goal; drive attach rows with test hook 'pagetask start <goalProgress>'. The helper echoes no goalAccept: state pageTask.lastAccept* shows what Tab sent.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T211204Z-f2f5d457e6044752","text":"H14: macOS notification banners cover Caret's panels at the screen's top right; a rig click there hits the banner. Give canned page goals a viewport lower down. clickableContent panels take a click only after a mouse move over them.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
